# Raw 1080p Seedance masters (~85 MB) — NOT needed to run the site.
# The derived frames (public/frames/hero) and background clips
# (public/video) ARE committed, so a fresh clone runs as-is.
# Only `npm run media` needs these. To version them, delete the line
# below and use Git LFS — plain git is a poor home for binary masters.
assets/*.mp4
